WEBVTT

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.570
That's it for today.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:48.920
Don't go stopping to shop or eat on your way home.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:53.270
Sensei, that's not something to warn high schoolers about.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.380
And don't go with any strangers!

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.020
Bye, bye!

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:57.840
See ya!

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.670
Go on ahead.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:01.600
'kay.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.510
Ayu, hurry up!

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.900
Wait up, Torako-san!

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.250
I wonder where the three of them are going?

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.710
Invite me!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:34.240
No, it's not like I want them to invite me exactly...

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.470
It's just that she's always so annoying with her "Takki, let's go home together!"

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:47.540
Could it be because I've been so cold to her every day?

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:50.960
No, that's just an act!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.290
Just an act!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.270
I'm actually...

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.240
Actually...

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.050
My true feelings...

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.360
Will you please stop that!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.370
Now, come my sweet!

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:30.040
I will embrace that lonely heart of yours!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.230
Givemeakiss!

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.550
Damn, rejected!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.610
Lonely?

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.100
Have I been lonely?

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.210
Lonely!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.440
I was lonely!

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.830
That cannot be.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:54.880
Ta-chan!  Tatsuki-chan!  You're stupid!  Stupid Tatsuki!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.330
That is absolutely not true!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.260
What in the world?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.140
Don't scare me like that.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:10.920
On the other hand, it is not that I should be glad to not have been invited today.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:15.810
But, I have always maintained a distance between myself and others.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.030
And besides, did I not request that you refrain from speaking to me so often?

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:23.700
Now then, could it be that you think of me as your friend?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.530
And so what of it?!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.750
There she goes scaring me again.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:46.470
I was alone in elementary school as well as middle school.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.040
Was it not for the best?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.820
Just like today...

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.850
But, before I knew it, I've...

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:27.380
And like, it was <i>so</i> funny!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.870
I am home.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.620
Worried

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.050
Ojou-sama!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.950
Toshiko-san, what is it?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.250
Ojou-sama, oh my...

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.360
Please hurry!

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.960
Hurry?  What is the matter?

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:52.680
The matter?  Your friends have already arrived.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:55.810
Huh?  Friends?

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.740
Hope ya don't mind us comin' over!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:12.040
If I may venture the questions, are you surprised?

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:12.950
Yes.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.030
Yes, yes!  I am surprised!

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:20.160
And if <i>I</i> may venture a question, why exactly are you here in my house?!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.460
I don't think I should be required to venture an answer to that question.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.880
Yes, you do, now venture an answer!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.250
And we already ventured to...

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:31.720
We all already took a look at your photo memory album, Tatsuki!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.680
Give that back!

00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:40.510
Ta-chan and Papa!  Mmm, the spitting image!

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:43.960
Ta-chan at age 2!  She's just like a doll!

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:47.070
Stop it already!

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:50.340
Ta-chan passes the entrance exam for Kamizono Academy's Elementary School!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.330
Doesn't she look cute in the uniform?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.180
I said, stop it!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.490
Aha, swimming with that family!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:57.480
Enough, return home at once!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.660
I'm sorry, Tatsuki-san!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.870
This really is bothering you, coming over unannounced like this...

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:10.750
It's okay, Ayumi.  I know you're not the type of person to do this.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.270
Tatsuki-san!

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.930
Isn't that nice, Ayu?

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:18.390
It does not change the fact that I wish for <i>you</i> to go home, however!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.310
However!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.350
Wait, seriously?

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.990
I am always serious!

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.280
Why so serious?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.120
It is your choice if you do not want to leave.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:46.370
What are you actually doing here?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.140
We don't really have any reason for it.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.400
What the heck?  It's all classical music?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.900
What is your real purpose here?

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:57.590
Don't you have a band you like or something?

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.940
I never said you could browse.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.350
Like I said, I don't really have a reason.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:07.310
Hey, where's the president?  Isn't he here?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.660
The president?

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.230
Oh, you mean my father?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:15.340
Father is away in Tokyo most of the year for work.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:18.070
And Mother comes and goes with him.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:21.900
Your house ain't exactly super big or anything either.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.660
What were you expecting, exactly?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:29.040
It is usually just me and Toshiko-san living here, so this is plenty of room.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:32.670
Oh, so Toshiko-san is the person we met before.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.330
I thought it was your mom at first.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.160
My...

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.930
Like I said...

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.640
2003 New Year's Greeting Cards

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.640
I never gave you permission to...

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.230
May I look?

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:52.920
Fine, but...

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.380
She said it was fine!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:57.400
I do not think you will find them very interesting.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:59.860
Happy New Year

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.330
Happy New Year
Let's get along this year as well!
New Year's Day

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.830
Best Wishes for a Happy New Year

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.000
Is there anyone in here we know?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.220
No, there is not.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:12.110
There isn't someone who's stuck around since elementary school like you?

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.470
Perhaps, but...

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:17.880
Not anyone that I have kept acquainted with.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.300
Takki...

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.160
You don't have many friends?

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.190
That can't be true, right?

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.650
I... Well...

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.420
Come in.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:14.480
Maidservant Kono Toshiko (51)

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:14.480
How about some of my homemade cookies, everyone?

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:16.330
Oh, thanks a bunch!

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.400
They look great!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.940
I'll have some!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.790
Thank you very much!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.990
I hope they are to your liking.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.650
Please, take your time, everyone.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.540
Toshiko-san!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.380
You really did not have to go through all that trouble.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.750
These are great!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.750
Yum!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.130
They really are good.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.810
There you go again.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:43.330
What are you so embarrassed about, Ojou-sama?

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:44.590
Embarrassed?

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:54.650
She's really nice, ya know?  Toshiko-san.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.130
Of course.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:02.360
She raised me since I was very little.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:07.350
She is like a second mother to me.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.570
Grown-up underwear!

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:23.010
Hey now, Suzume-san! What exactly do you think you are doing?!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.880
Do you lack even a hint of common sense?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.640
Grown-up panties!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.450
Please forgive her!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.870
Suzu really admires grown-up panties!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.000
Grown-up panties!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.180
You see, she's still wearing panties with animals prints!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.940
There was no need to show them to me!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.610
But, if I didn't show them to you then you wouldn't understand Suzu's feelings...

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:47.510
Are you saying you would feel sorry for Suzume-san if you had not done that?

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:50.420
Now, now, Tatsuki-san.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.940
Oh, that's right!  Ayu!  What about you, Ayu?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.290
Please stop! They're normal, totally normal!

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.150
Come in.

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:06.680
Everyone, how about having dinner together?

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:09.870
We're in!

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.100
Toshiko-san...

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.120
Wow, looks delicious!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.870
You all must be hungry.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.490
Please, eat.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.510
Thanks for the food!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.030
Thank you for the food.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.610
Ta-chan, hand me the sauce.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.310
You can reach it yourself, can you not?

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:36.210
Ayumi-san, would you like seconds?  We also have vegetables.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.620
But, but, but, I can't reach it without stretching!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.960
I don't think I can eat all of that.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.680
Then go ahead and stretch!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.220
No need to restrain yourself, dear.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.110
Look, honestly I just want you to pass it to me.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:45.650
And I, honestly, am busy eating!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.940
What's your malfunction, man?

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:50.440
Eat up, Suzume-san.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:51.260
Sure!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.610
Everyone, thank you so much.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:18.780
This is the first time Tatsuki-ojousama has ever called friends over to her house.

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.410
Please, stop it, Toshiko-san.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:25.150
I'm just so happy... So very happy...

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:27.330
To-Toshiko-san...

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.470
It's hot...

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.940
Now, Ojou-sama, let's serve up second helpings for your friends.

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:46.270
Toshiko-san, you're so nice.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:48.020
Ta-chan, pass me the sauce!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.400
You can reach it yourself, can you not?

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.340
Delicious!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.380
Yum!

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:19.180
Thanks for having us over!

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.570
Come again, will you?

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.740
Here, take these with you.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.800
Wow!  Definitely!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.660
That's the spirit.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.450
Um, Tatsuki-san...

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.350
Yes?

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.630
Thank you very much!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.680
I'm really sorry about coming over all unexpectedly like this.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.840
Be careful on your way home, okay?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.530
Sure!

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.490
Wasn't that food just great, Suzu?

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:44.790
It was!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.490
Toshiko-san's the best!

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.130
The best, the best!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.420
Maybe we should come back tomorrow?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.440
Yeah!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.090
Maybe we should come back tomorrow?

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.090
It's okay, Ayumi.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:51.820
Yeah!

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:54.770
It was actually pretty fun.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:38.820
The Story

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.830
Has Only Yet Begun

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.020
I said I'll be fine.

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.050
She Will Fight

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.350
Torako-san...

00:17:56.010 --> 00:18:00.090
Ta-chan, take care of Ayu for me.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.390
You make sure to come back, you hear!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.060
Yourself and Your Friends

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.330
I'm off!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.610
Torako-san!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.440
Ayumi!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.990
Put Their Fates on the Line!

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.120
Torako-san...

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.360
Flying Tiger...

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.160
Not bad...

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:32.020
Not bad at all!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.500
They Make Their Move!

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.170
Senpai!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:39.620
Leave him be!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.300
You can't stop him.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.070
So she is finally here.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:06.990
Yes.

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:07.990
The True Identity of the Strange Academy!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.380
Suzu...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.220
Don't address me so frivolously.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.560
You know not even the meaning of that name.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:23.780
Who the hell are you?

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:27.560
I have no particular problem showing you my true form.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.020
The void will come calling soon.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:38.480
The Void is Coming...

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.040
Void?

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.860
Soon...

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.970
Must we fight?

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:52.120
Well, it's obvious that what I'm fighting isn't really you.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:06.930
It's no use!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.720
We don't have anything long enough!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:09.670
They've... Gone Out of Control!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:22.190
Okay everyone, how about we hurry and get changed!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.610
Why?

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.530
It's my hobby.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:30.370
They're tight!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.500
Nice!  Best fit!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.830
There is some point to this, right, President?

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.120
There is.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.870
I've broken through.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:46.930
Excellent!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.800
Now follow me, everyone!

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:49.720
The Class Stands Together!!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.990
Where's the real Suzu!?

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:04.650
Torako.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.160
The Ultimate Enemy!!!

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:17.830
Torako, come over to our side.

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:23.710
Sensei...

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.450
That's far enough.

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:27.920
Don't think ill of me.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.640
Adults have their own reasons, after all.

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.330
Before you came to this school...

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.960
Before you were even born...

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.500
It was already decided.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.070
I refuse to believe that!

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:46.150
Fine, then don't believe it!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:56.590
Touma-san!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:59.990
Even if you go through with this, it's no use, Kazamatsuri!

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:03.040
We won't know if it's pointless or not until we try.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.050
That's what she'd say, anyway.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:28.070
Simulation A and B are both complete failures.

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:32.340
Use whatever methods are necessary.

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:34.050
Understood.

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:44.380
Beautiful Girl Awakens!!!!

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.840
Torako-oneechan...

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:13.880
Next time on Hyakko:

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:15.070
"Awakening"

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:20.480
