00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:21.910
What's on Hyakko next week?

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:25.210
It's a two-parter about the tiger finally meeting the fox, and the fox provoking the tiger's wrath!

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:27.630
So that scary older brother of hers will show up?

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:28.160
Yeah.

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.840
You mean the "Torako, come over to our side" guy?

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:31.340
Well, in the actual episode it's...

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:32.260
Look forward...

00:23:32.480 --> 00:23:34.470
Yeah, but that's not really what's gonna...
